    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Weaknesses: - our company's available capacity is limited to 4 concurrent public health engagements, so our company's need to ensure that our company's can allocate sufficient resources to this project. - While our company's have experience in the healthcare sector, our company's past references may not exactly match the scope and complexity of this project, which could pose a challenge. - The budget of €900,000 over 5 years may be relatively tight, considering the scope of this project and the need for progressive generalization to all services after the pilot phase." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, our company's has relevant strengths that can be leveraged to deliver this project, but our company's also need to carefully consider our company's weaknesses and ensure that our company's can allocate sufficient resources and manage this project effectively within the given budget and timeframe." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires a solution that integrates with existing hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI), supports health interoperability standards (HL7, FHIR), and provides a high level of answer relevance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Response times must be below 2 seconds for common queries, and the system must achieve an availability target of 99.9%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also support national health identifier (INS) and national framework (Ségur du Numérique en Santé, Mon Espace Santé, DMP)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What is our proposed technical architecture, and how will our ensure compliance with these requirements? our proposed technical architecture is based on our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform. our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform has several components that can be leveraged to meet the client's requirements, including a document-ingestion pipeline, vector store, retrieval layer with hybrid search, orchestration layer, and answer layer." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To integrate with existing hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI), our will utilize our standard connectors and custom adapters for SIH and DPI integration. our platform also supports health interoperability standards such as HL7 and FHIR through our API design, which is API-first (REST + webhook) and has documented APIs that can be embedded in existing work environments." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For high answer relevance, our Atelier platform's retrieval layer with hybrid search and the orchestration layer will ensure that the most relevant information is retrieved and presented to the user. our model-agnostic approach also allows our to choose the best-performing models for the specific use case, ensuring high answer relevance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To achieve response times below 2 seconds for common queries, our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform performance metrics indicate a median latency of 1.3 seconds, with common single-document queries being below 2 seconds at p95. our can also scale horizontally with additional inference capacity to ensure low latency for a large number of users." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
